### Peticiones de prueba de los módulos professionals y configuration.
### Primero se pide el token a Keycloak (necesita docker compose up -d); las demás peticiones lo usan.

### Inicio de sesión del administrador (guarda el token en {{adminToken}})
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/piedrazul/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=piedrazul-dev-tools&username=admin@gmail.com&password=admin-1234

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.access_token); %}

### Profesionales en orden alfabético por apellido
GET http://localhost:8081/api/professionals
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Especialidades
GET http://localhost:8081/api/professionals/specialties
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Ventana de agendamiento vigente
GET http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/scheduling-window
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cambiar la ventana a 6 semanas
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/scheduling-window
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weeks": 6
}

### Ventana fuera de rango: responde 400
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/scheduling-window
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weeks": 20
}

### Disponibilidad de Laura Martínez (configurada en los datos iniciales)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/availabilities/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Disponibilidad de Jorge Castillo (sin configurar): responde 204
GET http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/availabilities/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Configurar a Jorge Castillo: lunes y miércoles de 8:00 a 12:00, cada 45 minutos
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/availabilities/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workingDays": ["MONDAY", "WEDNESDAY"],
  "startTime": "08:00",
  "endTime": "12:00",
  "slotMinutes": 45
}

### Hora de fin anterior a la de inicio: responde 400
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/availabilities/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workingDays": ["MONDAY"],
  "startTime": "12:00",
  "endTime": "08:00",
  "slotMinutes": 30
}

### Un paciente no puede ver la configuración: responde 403
POST http://localhost:8180/realms/piedrazul/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=piedrazul-dev-tools&username=paciente1@gmail.com&password=paciente1-1234

> {% client.global.set("patientToken", response.body.access_token); %}

###
GET http://localhost:8081/api/configuration/scheduling-window
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}
